{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/b13e19e3c5471bbf413a79d0c0c9fdc2.apng?t=1772907889\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/b13e19e3c5471bbf413a79d0c0c9fdc2.poster.avif?t=1772907889\" class=\"bb_img\" width=150 height=20 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>\u200bBaratrum City, 2005.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Crimes. Demons. A\u00a0hellbound mob boss trying to do one last good thing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>\u200bBut the hellbound can't always be redeemed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/dc099b2a40a59ba51f073a0f16512ac9.poster.avif?t=1772907889\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/dc099b2a40a59ba51f073a0f16512ac9.webm?t=1772907889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/dc099b2a40a59ba51f073a0f16512ac9.mp4?t=1772907889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Demons and gangsters collide in a neon city of crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Loyalty is messy. Attraction is dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And one mob boss\u2019s final shot at redemption might cost him the only family he has left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After retiring from his reign in Hell, Zyne tries to keep his head down in Baratrum City's demonic underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He swore he'd never build another empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Then he formed the Otherworlders \u2013 a reckless gang built from his newest apprentice and the city\u2019s cheapest hires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He tells himself he\u2019s preparing her for a world he knows too well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It starts with a promising career path in armed robbery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The gang treats crime like a thrill, unaware of the guilt tied to Zyne's name and the consequences waiting in his shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the city closes in, the Otherworlders must confront what it really means to follow a legend carved in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Zyne must decide whether he becomes a monster again\u2026 or the father his apprentice needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This isn\u2019t just about taking back a city. It\u2019s about deciding who you are in it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>THE OTHERWORLDERS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/1416ebe16146534663bc7e3a03ee428a.avif?t=1772907889\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/5a16dc6aafc3a35d588f06dd2732e305.avif?t=1772907889\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Zyne is the leader.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Arania is his apprentice.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Keanu is his assassin.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Moose is his hacker.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Mr. Clean is... his drug dealer?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Together, they look like they\u2019re having the time of their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But when the mask falls and the rent comes due, they\u2019ll discover crime isn\u2019t as fun once you\u2019re the one bleeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- <strong>Play as Zyne, a retired demon mob boss</strong> dragged\u00a0back into the life he tried to leave behind</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- </i><strong><i>Recruit and manage the Otherworlders,</i></strong><i> an out-of-place crime gang bound by dirty money and worse decisions </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- <strong>Make choices</strong> in and outside of heists</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- <strong>Explore complicated relationships</strong> (doomed romance included)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- A\u00a0</i><strong><i>stylized, 2000s-inspired</i></strong><i> neon crime city </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- <strong>Over 100 hand-illustrated scenes,</strong> drawn by a human artist </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- A linear\u00a0</i><strong><i>4-hour narrative</i></strong><i> experience </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- Funkalicious <strong>synthwave soundtrack</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- Demons, crime, and one mob boss outta time!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702810?t=1772907889","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702810?t=1772907889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/76a2c12a3a563fa219d745e1804d17f27cdffda2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772907889","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/76a2c12a3a563fa219d745e1804d17f27cdffda2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772907889","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Depictions of drug and alcohol abuse, some implied/sexual scenes, some violence, and implied sexual assault."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/b13e19e3c5471bbf413a79d0c0c9fdc2.apng?t=1772907889\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.